<div class="field field--name--field-text-with-media field--type--text-long field--label--hidden">
    
      <div  class="field-text-with-media">  <div class="tex2jax_process"><p>There are four basic steps you can take to be more prepared for an earthquake: Step 1: Secure your space by identifying hazards and securing moveable items. Step 2: Plan to be safe by creating a disaster plan and deciding how you will communicate in an emergency. Step 3: Organize disaster supplies in convenient locations. Step 4: Minimize financial hardship by organizing important documents...</p></div>

